<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AGL sells office building.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AGL sells office building.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gas utility Australian Gas Light Co (AGL) said on Monday it has sold its 11 storey commercial office building in North Sydney to Westpac Property Trust for A$68.2 million with a mid-June settlement date.</p>
<p>AGL said the building was sold for a profit, but did not disclose the gain.</p>
<p>At 10.05 a.m. (1005 GMT), AGL shares were 10 cents up at A$7.50.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
